# Copy to .dev.vars to override wrangler.jsonc "vars" during `npm run dev` only (never deployed).
# Use the site index from a local Jekyll (docker compose up) before episode-links.json is live:
# SITE_INDEX_URL=http://localhost:4000/episode-links.json
# SITE_BASE_URL=https://www.arkbfm.com/episode/
# REFRESH_SECONDS=60
